        </relations>
    </header>
    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="12" relname="background">I'm in the process of creating a new corporate website for my employer.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="3" relname="volitional-cause">As a result of what I've learned so far in this course,</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="12" relname="span">I've made an effort to design the site to be functional and simple.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="14" relname="conjunction">I see too many sites that have annoying graphics that serve no purpose.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="14" relname="conjunction">I understand that some graphics are necessary to make a site visually appealing,</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="14" relname="conjunction">and I have tried to build some into our company's new website;</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="13" relname="span">however, I like the site much more after simplifying certain aspects of it.</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="9" relname="condition">However, once it's tested by more people</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="15" relname="span">I may find that everyone else finds it boring!</segment>
        <group id="10" type="span"/>
        <group id="11" type="span" parent="10" relname="span"/>
        <group id="12" type="span" parent="16" relname="span"/>
        <group id="13" type="span" parent="11" relname="span"/>
        <group id="14" type="multinuc" parent="7" relname="concession"/>
        <group id="15" type="span" parent="13" relname="concession"/>
        <group id="16" type="span" parent="11" relname="background"/>
    </body>
</rst>
